  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You draw a huge boulder out of the ground and send it rolling towards your foes.</p><p>Draw a <strong>10-space-line</strong>, starting at any point within <strong>10 spaces</strong> of you.</p><p>Creatures the selected spaces take <strong>1 Damage</strong>, and must succeed on an opposed <strong>Reflexes</strong> check, or be knocked <strong>Prone</strong>.</p><p>If they succeed, they must move to an adjacent space, out of the path of the boulder. If no such space exists, they automatically fail.</p><p>Each extra success increases the <strong>Damage</strong> by <strong>+1</strong>.</p>",
